# Use a flat, npm-style node_modules layout.
#
# Rationale: @browserbasehq/stagehand pulls in the AWS SDK, whose
# @aws-crypto/crc32 is marked `optional: true`. Under pnpm's default strict
# (symlinked) layout, a fresh `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` on CI (linux)
# does not reliably expose that optional subtree's transitive `tslib`, causing
# "Cannot find module 'tslib'" in llm-client.test.ts / integration.test.ts.
# A hoisted linker flattens dependencies so such transitive requires always
# resolve. Verified with a CI-identical `CI=true pnpm install --frozen-lockfile`.
node-linker=hoisted
